+
+Bind required information priority, visibility timing, content limits, and
+accessibility or behavior to their Product stable IDs. Record how the applicable
+visual authority maps those relationships into typography roles, weight, color
+attention, spacing, grouping, and responsive composition, together with the
+actual surface/state/viewport observation status:
+`{{PRODUCT_PRIORITY_TO_VISUAL_MAPPING_AND_OBSERVATION}}`.
+
